<script>

  let s = $data(() => __rvLoad("admin.notify", {}));
  function g(path, dflt) {
    let x = s();
    const parts = path.split(".");
    for (const p of parts) x = x == null ? undefined : x[p];
    return x == null || x === "" ? (dflt == null ? "" : dflt) : x;
  }
  function sw(path) {
    let x = s();
    const parts = path.split(".");
    for (const p of parts) x = x == null ? undefined : x[p];
    return x ? "1" : "0";
  }
</script>

<head>
  <title>短信设置 - 管理后台</title>
</head>

<form data-adm-form="notify">
  <div class="adm-toolbar">
    <strong style="font-size:16px">短信设置</strong>
    <span style="flex:1"></span>
    <button class="adm-btn" type="submit">保存设置</button>
  </div>
  <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:0 0 16px;">
    手机验证码由短信通道投递；短信密钥保存时留空表示不修改。
  </p>

  <div class="adm-section-title">短信通道</div>
  <div class="adm-card">
    <div class="adm-card-bd">
      <label class="adm-switch"><span><span class="t">启用短信通道</span><span class="d">手机验证码投递</span></span><input type="checkbox" name="sms.enabled" data-on={sw('sms.enabled')} data-bool></label>
      <div class="adm-field">
        <label>投递提供方</label>
        <select class="adm-select" name="sms.provider" data-val={g('sms.provider', 'webhook')}>
          <option value="webhook">自定义 Webhook</option>
          <option value="aliyun">阿里云短信</option>
          <option value="tencent">腾讯云短信</option>
        </select>
      </div>
      <div class="adm-field">
        <label>短信签名</label>
        <input class="adm-input" name="sms.signature" value={g('sms.signature', 'Oboext')}>
        <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:4px 0 0;">{"Webhook 模板中可用 {{sign}} 占位符引用此签名。"}</p>
      </div>

      <div data-show-if="sms.provider=webhook">
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label>Webhook 地址</label>
          <input class="adm-input" name="sms.webhook.url" value={g('sms.webhook.url')} placeholder="https://…">
        </div>
        <div class="adm-form-grid">
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>方法</label>
            <select class="adm-select" name="sms.webhook.method" data-val={g('sms.webhook.method', 'POST')}>
              <option value="POST">POST</option>
              <option value="GET">GET</option>
              <option value="PUT">PUT</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>请求体模板</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.webhook.body" value={g('sms.webhook.body')}>
            <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:4px 0 0;">{"支持 {{target}} {{code}} {{sign}} 占位符。"}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label>请求头（一行一个 Key: Value，或 JSON）</label>
          <textarea class="adm-textarea" name="sms.webhook.headers" rows="2" data-dv={g('sms.webhook.headers')}></textarea>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-show-if="sms.provider=aliyun">
        <div class="adm-form-grid">
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>AccessKeyId</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.aliyun.accessKeyId" value={g('sms.aliyun.accessKeyId')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>AccessKeySecret（留空不修改）</label>
            <input class="adm-input" type="password" name="sms.aliyun.accessKeySecret" value="" autocomplete="new-password">
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>短信签名名称</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.aliyun.signName" value={g('sms.aliyun.signName')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>模板 CODE</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.aliyun.templateCode" value={g('sms.aliyun.templateCode')} placeholder="SMS_123456789">
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>模板变量名</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.aliyun.codeParam" value={g('sms.aliyun.codeParam', 'code')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>接入点（留空默认）</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.aliyun.endpoint" value={g('sms.aliyun.endpoint')} placeholder="https://dysmsapi.aliyuncs.com">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-show-if="sms.provider=tencent">
        <div class="adm-form-grid">
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>SecretId</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.tencent.secretId" value={g('sms.tencent.secretId')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>SecretKey（留空不修改）</label>
            <input class="adm-input" type="password" name="sms.tencent.secretKey" value="" autocomplete="new-password">
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>SmsSdkAppId</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.tencent.sdkAppId" value={g('sms.tencent.sdkAppId')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>短信签名名称</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.tencent.signName" value={g('sms.tencent.signName')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>模板 ID</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.tencent.templateId" value={g('sms.tencent.templateId')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>地域</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.tencent.region" value={g('sms.tencent.region', 'ap-guangzhou')}>
          </div>
          <div class="adm-field">
            <label>接入点（留空按地域推导）</label>
            <input class="adm-input" name="sms.tencent.endpoint" value={g('sms.tencent.endpoint')} placeholder="https://sms.ap-guangzhou.tencentcloudapi.com">
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="adm-toolbar" style="margin:12px 0 0;">
        <input class="adm-input" style="max-width:280px;" data-notify-test-input="sms" placeholder="测试手机号">
        <button type="button" class="adm-btn adm-btn-ghost adm-btn-sm" data-adm-act="notify-test" data-channel="sms"><span class="adm-ic adm-ic-sm" style="--i:url(/public/icons/send.svg)"></span>发送测试短信</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="adm-section-title">手机验证码开关</div>
  <div class="adm-card">
    <div class="adm-card-bd">
      <div class="adm-form-grid">
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label class="adm-switch"><span><span class="t">注册强制手机验证</span></span><input type="checkbox" name="register.phoneVerify" data-on={sw('register.phoneVerify')} data-bool></label>
        </div>
        <div class="adm-field">
          <label class="adm-switch"><span><span class="t">允许手机验证码登录</span></span><input type="checkbox" name="login.phoneVerify" data-on={sw('login.phoneVerify')} data-bool></label>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="adm-hint" style="margin:10px 0 0;">
        手机验证码登录需短信通道已启用。会员注册服务在写库前消费对应验证码。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</form>
